{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The symbol <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/2/f42e32ea9361c740cbb968ee21d15749691f747c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive number or zero, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab0d6b0f629cdfba5b6ce68695ff0c5a2d6fd8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-a$\" width=\"23\" height=\"8\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a negative number. \nFor all real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/c/68c3ac0130ac3bbf7d58f2fe2d25e5842e75ab01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{t^4+t^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> is equal to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/2634eb8b7c5d49e86ca54c461272e479aca145c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ t^3\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ t^2+t\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ |t^2+t|\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ t\\sqrt{t^2+1}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ |t|\\sqrt{1+t^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"558\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factor out the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/b/b9be3299429b604a93ff4264b692f79a043abdb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t^2$\" width=\"12\" height=\"15\" /> inside the square root.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a2805faef09f91e4976bfeea21f5e7d85c01da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{t^2 \\cdot (t^2 + 1)}\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"32\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/9/b39b63892d6f4c522c2304f21c54c56315b779b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{t^2} \\cdot \\sqrt{t^2 + 1}\\]\" width=\"102\" height=\"19\" />\nRemember that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85dd82ba33d254108dc010b63126c92b82cbb25d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{t^2} = |t|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"22\" /> because square rooting a nonnegative real number will always result in a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Nonnegative_number\" title=\"Nonnegative number\">nonnegative number</a>.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/b/1dbad9c24e74e519aad83e9b1c3f174f046253d7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|t|\\sqrt{t^2 + 1}\\]\" width=\"75\" height=\"21\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p>Factor the expression under the radical:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/9/459ded2f6f0237b90140486861c84722f2ab0fd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{t^4+t^2}=\\sqrt{t^2(t^2+1)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"188\" height=\"35\" />\nBecause <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7473c5a1471a336117654c79464208a40ca115.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{t^2}=|t|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"24\" /> for every real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />, this becomes\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d547a447c852b579a6bb34d6e56d636d0ad6b3ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|t|\\sqrt{t^2+1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"23\" />\nThe absolute value is essential because a square root is nonnegative.\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961